  ✓ Implement behavior-preserving raw mode and centered_cosine mode
  ✓ Add CPU regression and centered-space unit tests
  ✓ Run focused and existing effect/regression suites
  ✓ Prepare matched proxy overrides and exact host-GPU launch commands
